OL,3,ABrazil pushes back on Macron calling   
OL,4,Aits meat 'doped'                       
OL,6,FMacron's comments come as part of a    
OL,7,Ftrade row between the EU and Mercosur -
OL,8,Fthe South American trade bloc. The EU  
OL,9,Fbanned Brazilian meat, poultry and     
OL,10,Fother animal products owing to the use 
OL,11,Fof antimicrobials in farming.          
